{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/ceb636ba9f3da8c25bb97987f82b3625.avif?t=1736191440\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Our Kickstarter was fully funded in less than 12 HOURS! Thanks to everyone for your continued support!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain Elemental magic and abilities as you search for 8 Elemental Stones in Elemythia. Explore, build, gather, and craft along your journey. You hold the fate of two worlds in your hand. This is your destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/3e15de99ded945573df9362ca1c5ea0f.poster.avif?t=1736191440\" width=668 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/3e15de99ded945573df9362ca1c5ea0f.webm?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/3e15de99ded945573df9362ca1c5ea0f.mp4?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemythia is yours to explore. Choose your path wisely.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure your mind is as sharp as your sword. You will encounter puzzles along the way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many creatures you encounter are tameable and mountable. Have fun exploring!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/bdca715a07b7cd218b4f56040cb4e01b.poster.avif?t=1736191440\" width=668 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/bdca715a07b7cd218b4f56040cb4e01b.webm?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/bdca715a07b7cd218b4f56040cb4e01b.mp4?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a homestead to store items, farm, or just relax by the fire. Use homesteads as fast travel points and customize them to make it feel like you are home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/0a6f769a31ab7724d65de0725842347d.poster.avif?t=1736191440\" width=668 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/0a6f769a31ab7724d65de0725842347d.webm?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/0a6f769a31ab7724d65de0725842347d.mp4?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect mounts, resources and elemental fragments along your journey. Use resources to craft gear, build, and enhance your magic abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your gear, abilities, and elemental magic to customize your character and find the most powerful build. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/ec9d526642aa0c05be8262f969dd05fd.poster.avif?t=1736191440\" width=668 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/ec9d526642aa0c05be8262f969dd05fd.webm?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/ec9d526642aa0c05be8262f969dd05fd.mp4?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Elemental stones will be protected by powerful guardians. When you are ready, challenge them for a chance at legendary Elemental gear.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee, Magic, or Ranged combat gives you a choice on how you defeat your enemies. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FAMILY AND FRIENDS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play local split-screen co-op and go in search of the Elemental stones with family and friends.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN A GROWING COMMUNITY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community to share ideas and help shape the game. We want you to get lost in the game while searching for the stones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/4e2d7a4a0a8defd9a1c629cf7f976b9d.poster.avif?t=1736191440\" width=600 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/4e2d7a4a0a8defd9a1c629cf7f976b9d.webm?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/4e2d7a4a0a8defd9a1c629cf7f976b9d.mp4?t=1736191440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1468110?t=1736191440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1736191440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736191440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736191440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/ceb636ba9f3da8c25bb97987f82b3625.avif?t=1736191440\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Our Kickstarter was fully funded in less than 12 HOURS! Thanks to everyone for your continued support!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain Elemental magic and abilities as you search for 8 Elemental Stones in Elemythia. Explore, build, gather, and craft along your journey. You hold the fate of two worlds in your hand. This is your destiny. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extras/3e15de99ded945573df9362ca1c5ea0f.poster.avif?t=1736191440\" width=668 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1468110/extr